────────────────────
+ This
    - offset = Point(0, 0)
    - follows-pointer = false

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Placement ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ get tracks-pointer

follows-pointer

────────────────────
+ place PlacementResult
    - request PlacementRequest

PlacementResult(Rect(x, y, width, height), Side.bottom)

.. origin = if follows-pointer then request.pointer else request.anchor.top-left
.. boundary = request.boundary
.. natural = placement-natural-size(request.popup, boundary)
.. width = min(natural.width, boundary.width)
.. height = min(natural.height, boundary.height)
.. forward-x = origin.x + offset.x
.. forward-y = origin.y + offset.y
.. fits-x = forward-x + width <= boundary.right
.. fits-y = forward-y + height <= boundary.bottom
.. x = placement-clamp(preferred-x, boundary.x, boundary.width, width)
.. y = placement-clamp(preferred-y, boundary.y, boundary.height, height)
.. preferred-x = if fits-x then forward-x else origin.x - offset.x - width
.. preferred-y = if fits-y then forward-y else origin.y - offset.y - height

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ CoverPlacement is Placement

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Placement ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ place PlacementResult
    - request PlacementRequest

PlacementResult(Rect(x, y, width, height))

.. anchor = request.anchor
.. boundary = request.boundary
.. focus = request.focus ?? Rect(0, 0, anchor.width, anchor.height)
.. natural = placement-natural-size(request.popup, boundary)
.. width = min(max(natural.width, anchor.width + focus.x * 2), boundary.width)
.. height = min(natural.height, boundary.height)
.. x = placement-clamp(anchor.x - focus.x, boundary.x, boundary.width, width)
.. y = placement-clamp(centered-y, boundary.y, boundary.height, height)
.. centered-y = anchor.y - focus.y + (anchor.height - focus.height) / 2

