    - top Length? = null

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Placement ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ place PlacementResult
    - request PlacementRequest

PlacementResult(Rect(x, y, width, height))

.. frame = request.window
.. natural = placement-natural-size(request.popup, frame)
.. width = min(natural.width, frame.width)
.. height = min(natural.height, frame.height)
.. x = frame.x + (frame.width - width) / 2
.. y = frame.y + (top ?? (frame.height - height) / 2)

