╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Placement ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ place PlacementResult
    - request PlacementRequest

PlacementResult(Rect(x, y, width, height))

.. frame = request.window
.. natural = placement-natural-size(request.popup, frame)
.. width = min(natural.width, gui-safe-span(frame.width - inset * 2))
.. height = min(natural.height, gui-safe-span(frame.height - inset * 2))
.. is-left = corner == Corner.top-left || corner == Corner.bottom-left
.. is-top = corner == Corner.top-left || corner == Corner.top-right
.. x = if is-left then frame.x + inset else frame.right - inset - width
.. y = if is-top then frame.y + inset else frame.bottom - inset - height

